# TypeScript incremental build state. This package's `build`/`typecheck`
# scripts both run `tsc -b`, which writes `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` next to the
# tsconfig — so it reappears untracked after any build or typecheck run.
#
# It was the only `tsc -b` emitter in `examples/` not covered by an ignore
# (`examples/react-nextjs-daisyui/web/.gitignore` already carries the same
# entry), which made a clean `git status` impossible here after running the
# project's own scripts.
*.tsbuildinfo
